# Optimize Compress
**/Optimize Compress/**/compress_PDF_output.pdf
**/Optimize Compress/**/sample.optimized.pdf

# Organize
**/Organize/**/Delete Blank Pages from PDF/**/sample.no_blank_pages.pdf
**/Organize/**/Delete unwanted Pages from PDF/**/Delete_unwanted_pages_from_PDF_output.pdf
**/Organize/**/Extract Pages/**/Extract_pages_PDF_output.pdf
**/Organize/**/Extract Pages/**/sample.extracted
**/Organize/**/Rotate Document/**/Rotate_document_PDF_output.pdf
**/Organize/**/Rotate Document/**/sample.rotated.pdf
**/Organize/**/Rotate Page/**/Rotate_page_PDF_output.pdf
**/Organize/**/Rotate Page/**/sample.page_rotated.pdf

# PDF
**/PDF/**/Get PDF Metadata/**/sample.metadata.json
**/PDF/**/Repair PDF Document/**/sample.repaired.pdf

# PDF4me
